{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sliding Hero is a <strong>brainteasing explorative puzzle game</strong> where you can only <strong>slide in a single direction</strong> until hitting an obstacle. <br> <br>Will you outsmart the villa\u2019s many trials and unmask the truth behind your imprisonment?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/SH_Map_Serre_Optimized.gif?t=1743077981\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A PUZZLE METROIDVANIA OF MOVEMENT AND MYSTERY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Imprisoned in a sinister Venetian villa, <strong>use your wits to help Luca Sicomoro</strong>, a Serenissima military man, escape. <strong>Every move is a test of strategy</strong>, turning movement into a puzzle. Navigate a dark and intricate world inspired by <strong>1700s Venice and Carnival\u2019s masked mystique,</strong> <strong>where danger and deception lurk in every shadow</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/SH_WeaponsShowcase_Optimized.gif?t=1743077981\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/SH_Spikes_Optimized.gif?t=1743077981\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MASTER THE SLIDE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use environmental hazards, weapons, artefacts, and your momentum to <strong>dispatch enemies and avoid deadly traps</strong>. Each encounter is a skill test, where <strong>puzzle-solving and combat seamlessly intertwine</strong> in an easy-to-learn, hard-to-master movement system.  <br>  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/SlidingHero_Weapons_Flintlock.gif?t=1743077981\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/SH_Enemies_SkullyMusket.gif?t=1743077981\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPLORE AN INTERCONNECTED WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The villa is a <strong>maze of hidden passageways, locked doors, and secrets</strong> waiting to be uncovered. <strong>Unlock new tools</strong> that let you <strong>backtrack</strong> to previously unreachable areas, <strong>forge shortcuts</strong>, and interact with the <strong>eccentric and enigmatic characters</strong> who dwell within.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/SlidingHero_Warp_Short.gif?t=1743077981\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A DARK VENETIAN DREAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into a beautifully hand-drawn pixel art world steeped in <strong>the elegance and unease of the Carnival of Venice</strong>. A haunting, original soundtrack inspired by <strong>Italian Baroque melodies</strong> enhances the atmosphere as you piece together <strong>a story of mystery, fate, and self-discovery</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/SH_Enemies_ElCapitan_ENG.gif?t=1743077981\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A unique puzzle-combat system</strong> built around momentum-based movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple weapons to unlock</strong>, each with a specific puzzle mechanic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>An atmospheric Venetian setting</strong>, blending historical beauty with eerie fantasy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nonlinear Metroidvania exploration</strong>\u2014discover new abilities to open fresh paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Engaging and devious boss fights</strong>, where strategy is key.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A fast-paced movement system</strong> designed with speedrunning in mind.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2966300?t=1743077981","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2966300?t=1743077981","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/950674b8d7f06e2aa7d158f0d689eaef79bcb026/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743077981","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/950674b8d7f06e2aa7d158f0d689eaef79bcb026/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743077981","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3003410,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sliding Hero is a <strong>brainteasing explorative puzzle game</strong> where you can only <strong>slide in a single direction</strong> until hitting an obstacle. <br> <br>Will you outsmart the villa\u2019s many trials and unmask the truth behind your imprisonment?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/SH_Map_Serre_Optimized.gif?t=1743077981\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A PUZZLE METROIDVANIA OF MOVEMENT AND MYSTERY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Imprisoned in a sinister Venetian villa, <strong>use your wits to help Luca Sicomoro</strong>, a Serenissima military man, escape. <strong>Every move is a test of strategy</strong>, turning movement into a puzzle. Navigate a dark and intricate world inspired by <strong>1700s Venice and Carnival\u2019s masked mystique,</strong> <strong>where danger and deception lurk in every shadow</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/SH_WeaponsShowcase_Optimized.gif?t=1743077981\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/SH_Spikes_Optimized.gif?t=1743077981\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MASTER THE SLIDE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use environmental hazards, weapons, artefacts, and your momentum to <strong>dispatch enemies and avoid deadly traps</strong>. Each encounter is a skill test, where <strong>puzzle-solving and combat seamlessly intertwine</strong> in an easy-to-learn, hard-to-master movement system.  <br>  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/SlidingHero_Weapons_Flintlock.gif?t=1743077981\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/SH_Enemies_SkullyMusket.gif?t=1743077981\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPLORE AN INTERCONNECTED WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The villa is a <strong>maze of hidden passageways, locked doors, and secrets</strong> waiting to be uncovered. <strong>Unlock new tools</strong> that let you <strong>backtrack</strong> to previously unreachable areas, <strong>forge shortcuts</strong>, and interact with the <strong>eccentric and enigmatic characters</strong> who dwell within.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/SlidingHero_Warp_Short.gif?t=1743077981\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A DARK VENETIAN DREAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into a beautifully hand-drawn pixel art world steeped in <strong>the elegance and unease of the Carnival of Venice</strong>. A haunting, original soundtrack inspired by <strong>Italian Baroque melodies</strong> enhances the atmosphere as you piece together <strong>a story of mystery, fate, and self-discovery</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/SH_Enemies_ElCapitan_ENG.gif?t=1743077981\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A unique puzzle-combat system</strong> built around momentum-based movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple weapons to unlock</strong>, each with a specific puzzle mechanic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>An atmospheric Venetian setting</strong>, blending historical beauty with eerie fantasy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nonlinear Metroidvania exploration</strong>\u2014discover new abilities to open fresh paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Engaging and devious boss fights</strong>, where strategy is key.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A fast-paced movement system</strong> designed with speedrunning in mind.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Silent Chicken"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/header.jpg?t=1743077981","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257101080,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101080/movie480.mp4?t=1740225107","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101080/movie_max.mp4?t=1740225107